WEBVTT

00:09:59.232 --> 00:10:00.676
This is frightening.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:03.454
You feel frightened.
Of course you feel frightened.

00:10:03.478 --> 00:10:06.175
And this man, Terry Jones:

00:10:06.199 --> 00:10:08.946
I mean here's a guy
who wants to burn Qurans, right?

00:10:08.970 --> 00:10:11.623
And the Americans:
"Ah, he's a knucklehead.

00:10:11.647 --> 00:10:15.276
He's a former hotel manager; he's got
three dozen members of his church ..."

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:16.467
They laugh him off.

00:10:16.491 --> 00:10:19.677
You don't laugh him off,
because in the context of everything else,

00:10:19.701 --> 00:10:20.852
all the pieces fit.

00:10:20.876 --> 00:10:22.760
Of course this is how Americans think.

00:10:22.784 --> 00:10:25.787
So people all over the Middle East,
not just in your country,

00:10:25.811 --> 00:10:26.967
are protesting.

00:10:26.991 --> 00:10:28.922
"He wants to burn Qurans, our holy book.

00:10:28.946 --> 00:10:31.074
These Christians --
who are these Christians?